      {
        "id": "page_report",
        "title": "Report",
        "kind": "report",
        "body": "# Regional performance\n\nBoth pictures below are **HTML Template** nodes: a table repeated into a\nblock of hand-written HTML, dressed by one **Visual Style** node. Nothing\nhere is fetched from the internet, so this page prints the same on any\nmachine.\n\n## Where the revenue is\n\n![[Revenue by region]]\n\n## The league table\n\nRank, share of the biggest region, and which way each one is moving \u2014 the\nkind of page a chart library will not draw for you.\n\n![[Regional league table]]\n",
        "tiles": []
      }
